; FvgGold EA - FundedNext Stellar 2-Step 25K
; ATTACH TO XAUUSD  M15   (FVGTimeframe is M15, HTF bias is H1)
;
; Changed from the vendor FvgGold.set:
;   FixedLot        0.01 -> 0.0     see below - this is not optional
;   RiskPercent     0.5  -> 0.35    $87.50 per trade on 25k
;   DailyLossLimit  5.0  -> 300.0   the vendor value halts after a $5 loss
;
; ================= READ THIS FIRST =================
; THIS EA HAS NO TOTAL-DRAWDOWN GUARD. Searched the source: DailyLossLimit is
; the only protection that exists. There is no max-loss stop, no equity guard,
; no baseline. Nothing in this EA will stop it at -$1500.
;
; That is why DailyLossLimit is 300 and not 750. The arithmetic:
;     daily 750  ->  two bad days and a half reaches -1500. Account gone.
;     daily 300  ->  FIVE bad days to reach it, and you get to notice.
; It costs some upside. It buys the only margin available, because the firm's
; max-loss rule is unprotected by the software.
;
; You still have to watch the cumulative figure yourself. Set an alert in the
; FundedNext dashboard, or remove the EA manually at -$1000.
;
; ================= WHY FixedLot MUST BE 0 =================
; CalcLot() checks "if(FixedLot > 0)" FIRST and returns immediately. While
; FixedLot is 0.01 the RiskPercent setting does NOTHING - every trade is a
; flat 0.01 lot regardless. With FixedLot=0.0 the 0.35% actually applies.
;
; ================= UNCHANGED, AND WHY =================
; The strategy inputs - MinGapSize 25, MinScoreFVG 50, the score weights,
; UseOBFilter, EMA 50/200, HTF H1 - are the author's defaults. There is no
; backtest in the repo to justify changing any of them, and guessing would
; only mean running something nobody has tested.
;
; MaxTrades stays 1. One position at a time keeps exposure to 0.35% and
; matters more than usual here given there is no total-loss guard.
;
; ================= KNOWN ISSUE: KILLZONES IGNORE DST =================
; KZ_* are fixed GMT hours read from TimeGMT(), with no daylight-saving
; handling anywhere in the source. 7-10 GMT is the WINTER-correct London
; killzone; for roughly five months a year every window sits an hour off the
; session it is named after. Broker-independent, so no InpServerGmtOffset
; problem - but the labels are wrong in summer. Shift each KZ_* value down by
; 1 between late March and late October if you want them accurate.
;
; ================= BEFORE IT TRADES =================
;   * Compile FvgGold.mq5 with F7. Third-party source, never built here.
;   * There is NO BACKTEST in that repo - no results, no equity curve, no
;     data. The landing page shows an equity chart and a demo video; that is
;     marketing, not something you can verify. Run it on 2023-2026 first.
;   * Magic 7777 does not collide with 990021 / 993000 / 994000 / 995000
;     (our EAs) or 52731 (Gold Reaper), so it can run alongside them.
FVGTimeframe=PERIOD_M15||PERIOD_M15||PERIOD_M15||PERIOD_M15||N
MinGapSize=25||25||25||25||N
MaxAgeBars=20||20||20||20||N
MinAgeBars=2||2||2||2||N
FVGBuffer=3.0||3.0||3.0||3.0||N
MinScoreFVG=50.0||50.0||50.0||50.0||N
ScoreGapWeight=30.0||30.0||30.0||30.0||N
ScoreDispWeight=30.0||30.0||30.0||30.0||N
ScoreHTFWeight=20.0||20.0||20.0||20.0||N
ScoreFreshWeight=10.0||10.0||10.0||10.0||N
ScorePDWeight=10.0||10.0||10.0||10.0||N
UseOBFilter=true||true||true||true||N
OB_ImpulseATR=1.5||1.5||1.5||1.5||N
OB_LookbackBars=50||50||50||50||N
OB_MinSize=10.0||10.0||10.0||10.0||N
OB_ConfluenceBonus=20.0||20.0||20.0||20.0||N
OB_MaxDistance=200.0||200.0||200.0||200.0||N
HTF_Period=PERIOD_H1||PERIOD_H1||PERIOD_H1||PERIOD_H1||N
EMA_Fast=50||50||50||50||N
EMA_Slow=200||200||200||200||N
FixedLot=0.0||0.01||0.01||0.01||N
RiskPercent=0.35||0.5||0.5||0.5||N
MaxTrades=1||1||1||1||N
DailyLossLimit=300.0||5.0||5.0||5.0||N
ATR_TP_Mult=2.0||2.0||2.0||2.0||N
RiskRewardRatio=1.5||1.5||1.5||1.5||N
UseFixedRR=true||true||true||true||N
UseKillzone=true||true||true||true||N
KZ_LondonStart=7||7||7||7||N
KZ_LondonEnd=10||10||10||10||N
KZ_OverlapStart=12||12||12||12||N
KZ_OverlapEnd=16||16||16||16||N
KZ_NYEnd=21||21||21||21||N
KZ_PreferOverlap=false||false||false||false||N
CloseAtEOD=false||false||false||false||N
MagicNumber=7777||7777||7777||7777||N
SlippagePoints=20||20||20||20||N
